# The ZuloOne server writes every workspace file with LF endings and records a
# hash of what it wrote in the export ledger. Without this file, core.autocrlf
# rewrites files to CRLF on checkout; every file then differs from the ledger,
# and the live-sync export gate HOLDS on ~1700 phantom "changed on disk" paths
# — the sync silently stops applying anything.
#
# Keep LF on checkout for everything the server owns.
* text=auto eol=lf
